ucture to explain clearly what a tool-using model does and how its step-by-step loop works. A is vaguer ('this work', 'computer assistant') and its sentences connect loosely, though its point about checking the actual result is a valuable one.\"}", "raw": {"duration_api_ms": 3230, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "session_id": "78b7e6d2-1b77-4c6a-b175-ec93e307c869", "total_cost_usd": 0.0155368, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1629, "cache_read_input_tokens": 1484, "output_tokens": 110, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "server_tool_use": {"web_search_requests": 0, "web_fetch_requests": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1629, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "inference_geo": "global", "iterations": [{"input_tokens": 2, "output_tokens": 110, "cache_read_input_tokens": 1484, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1629, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1629}, "type": "message"}], "speed": "standard", "fallback_credit": null}, "modelUsage": {"claude-opus-5-5": {"inputTokens": 2, "outputTokens": 110, "cacheReadInputTokens": 1484, "cacheCreationInputTokens": 1629, "webSearchRequests": 0, "costUSD": 0.0155368, "contextWindow": 1000000, "maxOutputTokens": 128000, "thinkingTokens": 0, "canonicalModel": "claude-opus-5-5", "provider": "firstParty", "costBasis": "list"}}, "permission_denials": [], "terminal_reason": "completed", "fast_mode_state": "off", "fast_mode_disabled_reason": "sdk_opt_in_required", "subagent_stats": {"spawned": 0, "requested": {"background": 0, "foreground": 0, "unset": 0}, "started_in_background": 0, "max_depth": 0, "spawned_by_subagents": 0, "completed": 0, "failed": 0, "killed": {"parent": 0, "user": 0, "system": 0}, "refused": {"depth_limit": 0, "concurrency_limit": 0, "budget": 0}, "by_type": {}}, "safety_stops": 0, "is_error": false, "num_turns": 1, "subtype": "success", "api_error_status": null, "result": "{\"better\": \"B\", \"